domain ADR0060:
  description "Accepted revision1: explicit owner decisions for test contract recovery."
evidence OWNER_ACCEPTANCE:
  "2026-10-08 owner directs unknown visibility private, owner-directed friends, contemporaneous rating snapshots, cooldown abolition with STA costs and awareness, discretionary free-action penalties with kinds pending, preserve equipment effects, 429 one-hour fallback, and ADR0059 recommendation."
evidence SCOPE:
  "docs/battle-test-contract-owner-decisions-2026-10-08.md records exact selected behavior and pending numeric/penalty/snapshot compatibility design. Original247unit+4E2E and immutable recorded battles remain protected. No paid/live/deploy authority."
decision ACCEPTANCE based_on OWNER_ACCEPTANCE, SCOPE:
